Beyond supplying parts, the company offers engineering support and plant audits, helping clients choose the right drive component for their machinery and identifying the root cause of repeated equipment failures rather than just replacing worn parts. This diagnostic approach is aimed at reducing downtime and maintenance costs over time. Trading from Edelweiss Avenue in Magalieskruin, Nexus Transmission Components serves industrial and agricultural operations across the region needing correctly specified drive components.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://nexustc.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'nexus-transmission-components-magalieskruin' AND description = 'Nexus Transmission Components is an engineering sourcing partner supplying precision drive components and heavy-duty conveyor chains, including gears, couplings, chains, bearings, locking elements, and universal joints, with access to over 40,000 German-engineered parts and engineering support.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
