Installations include in-app monitoring so clients can track their system''s performance after the fact, and every job is finished with a Certificate of Compliance. The company also installs solar water heating and offers ongoing maintenance and repairs for existing solar systems, not only new installations. Based on Brink Street in Eldoraigne, OpenSky Solar Energy Solutions serves Centurion and the wider Pretoria area with ECSA-accredited installation work backed by after-sales support.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.openskysolar.co.za/about', '$[#]', 'https://openskysolar.co.za/solar-company-centurion'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'opensky-solar-energy-solutions-eldoraigne' AND description = 'OpenSky Solar Energy Solutions is an ECSA-accredited solar company in Eldoraigne, Centurion, designing and installing domestic and commercial PV systems including grid-tied solar, hybrid inverters and battery backup, plus solar water heating and system maintenance and repairs.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
