Its Riviera location puts guests within easy reach of the Union Buildings, the National Zoological Gardens, Church Square and Paul Kruger House, along with nearby restaurants, bars and shopping centres, making it a practical base for sightseeing as well as business travel. The guesthouse caters to domestic, business and international travellers looking for an affordable, residential-feel stay close to the city rather than a large hotel in the centre of Pretoria.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.oppihoek.com/about', '$[#]', 'https://www.sa-venues.com/visit/oppihoekguesthouse'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'oppi-hoek-guesthouse-riviera' AND description = 'Oppi Hoek Guesthouse is a bed and breakfast in Riviera, Pretoria, offering single, double and twin en-suite rooms with DSTV, Wi-Fi, an indoor braai area and an on-site restaurant, close to the Union Buildings and Church Square.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
